title: 주3_수_2교시_식당_서은표_영문
---
<<play 공통_웅성>>
(The cafeteria is crowded today as well.)
<<show pyo_idle>>
<<play pyo_sound>>
(I see EunPyo standing in front of the menu, looking indecisive.)
{name()}: Hey.
<<show pyo_shock>>
(EunPyo jumps in surprise.)
EunPyo: Oh, {name()}!
EunPyo: Are you here for lunch?
{name()}: Yeah. Want to eat together?
<<show pyo_neg>>
<<play 서은표_흠>>
EunPyo: I'd love to. I'm actually struggling to decide what to eat...
{name()}: I'm going to have the Spicy Pork Bowl.
<<show pyo_idle>>
EunPyo: Hmm... then I'll go with the Udon.
{name()}: Udon sounds good too. Want to share when the food comes out?
<<show pyo_smile>>
EunPyo: Sure. I like Spicy Pork Bowl too.
(We finished ordering and sat down.)
(After a brief chat, the food arrived.)
<<show pyo_neg>>
EunPyo: Uh...
(When we got our food, EunPyo's eyes went wide, and she looked completely flustered.)
(Looking down at the tray, there's Shrimp Fried Rice instead of Udon.)
{name()}: Wait a second. This isn't Udon.
<<show pyo_neg2>>
<<play 서은표_허>>
EunPyo: You're right... they must have given me the wrong order.
EunPyo: The thing is, I can't eat shrimp.
{name()}: Oh... really? Of all things, it had to be shrimp. What should we do?
<<choice 주3_수_2교시_식당_서은표_긍1_영문 "Right. Let's go tell them and get it swapped." 주3_수_2교시_식당_서은표_부1_영문 "Hmm... do you want to just have mine?">>
EunPyo: Should I go tell them?
===

title: 주3_수_2교시_식당_서은표_긍1_영문
---
<<like 서은표>>
<<change lvPyo +5>>
{name()}: Right. Let's go tell them and get it swapped.
<<show pyo_idle>>
EunPyo: Yeah...
(EunPyo seems to be hesitating.)
EunPyo: Honestly, I'm not very good at speaking up about things like this...
<<choice 주3_수_2교시_식당_서은표_긍2_영문 "Well, it's not that hard." 주3_수_2교시_식당_서은표_부2_영문 "I'm not great at it either, but...">>
EunPyo: Could you... maybe speak for me...?
===

title: 주3_수_2교시_식당_서은표_긍2_영문
---
<<like 서은표>>
<<change lvPyo +5>>
{name()}: Well, it's not that hard.
{name()}: Okay. I'll go.
(I took the Shrimp Fried Rice and explained the situation to the staff.)
(Fortunately, the issue was resolved quickly.)
(I successfully got the Udon.)
<<show pyo_smile>>
EunPyo: Thank you, seriously...
<<show pyo_blush>>
<<play 서은표_흠>>
EunPyo: I'm so bad at speaking up, so someone who can do that for me is totally my type.
{name()}: Really? Then I guess I pass.
EunPyo: Oh, stop it~~ Is that how it works?
(We chatted while enjoying our meal.)
<<end>>
===

