title: 주3_수_2교시_식당_서은표_부1_영문
---
<<like 서은표>>
<<change lvPyo +10>>
{name()}: Hmm... do you want to just have mine?
{name()}: If you're okay with the Spicy Pork Bowl, take this.
<<show pyo_neg>>
EunPyo: Really? I mean, I'm okay with it, but...
{name()}: Yeah. Let's swap. I like shrimp anyway.
<<show pyo_blush>>
<<play 서은표_흠>>
EunPyo: Thank you... then let's swap.
<<show pyo_smile>>
EunPyo: I'll buy you a drink after we finish.
(We chatted while enjoying our meal.)
<<end>>
===